		<description><![CDATA[On this evening of August 13th. 2012, I am remembering you Jacob. August 2009 was the last time I saw you. We were all at NWSC &amp; I met you on the path as I was carrying my camping gear to the car on the last day of camp. 
  You smiled &amp; looked down, as you walked down toward camp,  &amp; then you touched your heart. I was very moved, to the point of tears as I drove out of camp.  This memory of you  I hold clearly, yet we all learned that Sunday night that you had passed through the west gate. 
 This LOVE that continues.
Wopila, thank you
Nurjamila
